                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e97499c5-0952-4e6b-a828-84cef96245be",
                        "source_entry_id": "e6fc3de5-b9d6-3fd0-bf57-4a0f0566ef53",
                        "source_sense_id": "acea2b5e-ac9a-3f4e-9b8a-f179be0abb13",
                        "target_lang_word": "inquisitive",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inquisitive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "30066d9c-20b0-3241-b204-050aa7132d0c",
                                        "entry_id": "af5d33bb-4e3b-3d0e-9b21-c879f497bb1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eager to acquire knowledge; acquisitive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ad9d0c8-c87f-44c2-8178-4bfc8fb05ed9",
                                                "sense_id": "30066d9c-20b0-3241-b204-050aa7132d0c",
                                                "text": "[…] a young, inquiſitive and ſprightly Genius; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5eb9d9d-cb60-38c7-ae74-e39cc8fdba97",
                                        "entry_id": "af5d33bb-4e3b-3d0e-9b21-c879f497bb1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Too curious; overly interested; nosy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f2c2177-f986-47dd-995e-46212fea1ff9",
                                                "sense_id": "d5eb9d9d-cb60-38c7-ae74-e39cc8fdba97",
                                                "text": "A wiſe man is not inquiſitive about things impertinent; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9632b5b6-2a12-4173-a58b-75dbe1f3d701",
                                                "sense_id": "d5eb9d9d-cb60-38c7-ae74-e39cc8fdba97",
                                                "text": "Huddled together in loathsome files, they squat there over night, or until an inquisitive policeman breaks up the congregation with his club, which in Mulberry Street has always free swing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0eb565c1-09db-4557-9874-c26d3221d1ae",
                                                "sense_id": "d5eb9d9d-cb60-38c7-ae74-e39cc8fdba97",
                                                "text": "No, no, Bertha; we must not give them reason to say that their neighbours are inquisitive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7372fa88-6694-47fc-8293-799282df1f8a",
                                                "sense_id": "d5eb9d9d-cb60-38c7-ae74-e39cc8fdba97",
                                                "text": "― Everybody gets their own ration of luck, they say. Now you mention it his face was familiar to me. But leaving that for the moment, how much did you part with, he queried, if I am not too inquisitive?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c638f8f6-0e38-4d4f-8baf-f6089cfca298",
                        "source_entry_id": "e6fc3de5-b9d6-3fd0-bf57-4a0f0566ef53",
                        "source_sense_id": "acea2b5e-ac9a-3f4e-9b8a-f179be0abb13",
                        "target_lang_word": "inquisitif",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inquisitif",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37672624-a84c-3b11-867f-fec4066f97b2",
                                        "entry_id": "5a38e37e-36c1-348e-91c6-7f2d8b055418",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui recherche la vérité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "332e9721-f195-4186-898b-4c165249c7df",
                                                "sense_id": "37672624-a84c-3b11-867f-fec4066f97b2",
                                                "text": "Son air sérieux et inquisitif lorsqu’il m’aborda me parut d’autant plus extraordinaire qu’ayant écrit et recapitulé tout ce qui s’étoit passé pendant tout le tems des confrontations, je ne pouvois m’imaginer ce qui avoit pu produire ce changement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a28ed8b2-4da6-41a6-925b-bda482a7df0b",
                                                "sense_id": "37672624-a84c-3b11-867f-fec4066f97b2",
                                                "text": "Cependant il sentait confusément que ce n’était pas la première fois qu’il se trouvait en contact avec cet énigmatique personnage qui, peu soucieux de cet examen inquisitif dont il paraissait avoir conscience, tourna tout à fait le dos à la salle en se penchant vers la cheminée sous figure de se chauffer les mains de plus près."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d4b288a-45fd-4a3f-8409-18f3f9fae797",
                                                "sense_id": "37672624-a84c-3b11-867f-fec4066f97b2",
                                                "text": "L’auteur de l’article publie cette anecdote d’abord comme preuve de son opinion que le coq n’avait pas le droit de figurer parmi les animaux héraldiques, et ensuite que l’esprit de ce gouvernement était inquisitif et méticuleux, puisqu’il prétendait maintenir intactes les prérogatives du blason."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
